# Staging only

All development for this product happens on `staging`. That includes the frontend repo and the backend repo.

- Before the first edit in a turn, run `git branch --show-current`. If it is not `staging`, switch to `staging` before changing files.
- Commit and push only to `staging`, and only when the user asks.
- Do not commit, push, merge, or open work on `main`. A pull request into `main` is not permission to keep developing there.
- Do not commit `.cursor/` unless the user asks.
